  "scope": "Ardmore Avenue to 71st Street, the Lakefront Trail and adjoining parks, with selected nearby cultural destinations. This is a curated visitor atlas, not an inventory of every city object.",
  "method": [
    "Compared existing discoveries with primary Park District beach, natural-area, public-art and park facility inventories, Chicago Harbors destinations, Navy Pier venues and institution visitor pages.",
    "Matched each addition to its named OSM node, way or relation in the cached geographic extract. Polygon coordinates are area-weighted centroids checked inside their source geometry, or explicitly documented interior reference points; open-line points use a length-weighted midpoint.",
    "Rejected generic Park District administrative addresses as coordinates. Current operator visitor notices override older schedules and historical facility maps.",
    "Kept major independent destinations and identifiable artworks; represented ensembles and ordinary amenities through their parent place. No claim of on-site field verification."
